WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.580
But here's where a lot of salespeople

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.880
get into trouble.

3
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.980
We confuse having a goal with having

4
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:05.630
a plan.

5
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.910
$5 million might be a perfectly reasonable

6
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:09.090
target for your territory,

7
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.790
but just because someone puts a number

8
00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.790
on a piece of paper doesn't mean

9
00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.490
there's a strategy behind actually achieving it.

10
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:17.950
What happens when we don't have a

11
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.350
strategy? We become reactive,

12
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:23.150
spend our days responding to customer calls,

13
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.730
chasing quotes, handling problems,

14
00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.870
and working whatever opportunities happen to come

15
00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:28.665
our way.

16
00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:30.425
But there's a big difference between being

17
00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:33.265
busy selling equipment and intentionally building a

18
00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:34.890
territory that produces results.

19
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:36.390
Are you controlling your territory or is

20
00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.790
it controlling you?

21
00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.650
Because if we're gonna consistently hit our

22
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.100
numbers, we need to be doing more

23
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.020
than just reacting to what's happening around

24
00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.640
us. We need to be intentional about

25
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.325
where we spend our time and how

26
00:00:46.325 --> 00:00:47.325
we develop our business.
